[pulsarsocial-mcp] PULSARSOCIAL_API_KEY is not set. Add it to the "env" block of this server in your MCP client config.

PulsarSocial MCP bridge

  Connects an stdio-only MCP client to https://getpulsarsocial.com/mcp so your
  agent can list connected social accounts, validate a post, and schedule it.

Environment
  PULSARSOCIAL_API_KEY   (required)  A workspace API key: utsk_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx.<secret>
                                 Create one at https://getpulsarsocial.com → Settings → API keys.
                                 Available on every plan, including the free Hobby plan.
  PULSARSOCIAL_BASE_URL  (optional)  Defaults to https://getpulsarsocial.com.

Example client config
  {
    "mcpServers": {
      "pulsarsocial": {
        "command": "npx",
        "args": ["-y", "@pulsarsocial/mcp"],
        "env": { "PULSARSOCIAL_API_KEY": "utsk_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx.your-secret-here" }
      }
    }
  }

Docs: https://getpulsarsocial.com/docs
